{
  "id": "RAW_9df49ed53b",
  "title": "EmbeddingGemma 2：一款开源、轻量级的多模态嵌入模型",
  "url": "https://deepmind.google/blog/embeddinggemma-2-an-open-lightweight-multimodal-embedding-model/",
  "date": "2026-10-07 00:43:55",
  "author": "Sahil Dua",
  "siteName": "Google DeepMind News",
  "content": "<!--article text-->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"nmcpy\">We introduced <a href=\"https://developers.googleblog.com/en/introducing-embeddinggemma/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">EmbeddingGemma</a> last year to provide a lightweight option for high-quality text embeddings, to help your apps organize, search, and connect information directly on consumer hardware. The developer community’s response blew past our expectations. With more than 20 million downloads, builders have used it to power smarter on-device search tools and privacy-first retrieval augmented generation (RAG) pipelines.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"fbc7q\">Today, we’re launching EmbeddingGemma 2<b>,</b> expanding beyond text to unify code, images, video, and audio in a shared embedding space. Built on the Gemma 4 architecture and released under a commercially permissive Apache 2.0 license, EmbeddingGemma 2 has 740 million parameters, making it optimal for on-device inference. It can help find a specific video clip from a voice memo, or search through hours of audio recordings based on a text query, all processed by a single, natively multimodal model.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"EmbeddedGemma 2 Launch Video\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"EmbeddedGemma 2 Launch Video\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EG2_Launch_v13_Delivery_Clean_1.mp4\" section-header=\"EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\" poster-image-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Introducing_EmbeddingGemma2_v02.png\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n     <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n      <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"EmbeddedGemma 2 Launch Video\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EG2_Launch_v13_Delivery_Clean_1.mp4\" poster-image-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Introducing_EmbeddingGemma2_v02.png\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\" video-title=\"EmbeddedGemma 2 Launch Video\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"EmbeddedGemma 2 Launch Video\" class=\" uni-video-player__video reduce-motion-disabled \" style=\"min-height:0px;\" preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Introducing_EmbeddingGemma2_v02.png\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EG2_Launch_v13_Delivery_Clean_1.mp4\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EG2_Launch_v13_Delivery_Clean_1.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n        <div class=\" uni-video-player__controls uni-video-player__controls--unstarted \">\n         <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n         <button class=\" uni-video-player__button uni-video-player__button--main uni-video-player__button--main--active \" aria-label=\"Play video\"><uni-icon-component icon-id=\"play-arrow\"><!----></uni-icon-component></button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n      <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"nmcpy\">Built from the same technology as Gemini Embedding models, EmbeddingGemma 2 is:</p>\n     <ul>\n      <li data-block-key=\"8i55i\"><b>Best-in-class for its size:</b> Achieves leading scores among sub-1B multimodal embedders for its size across benchmarks like MTEB (Massive Text Embedding Benchmark) Code and MAEB (Massive Audio Embedding Benchmark), while matching or outperforming many larger models across text, vision, and audio tasks.</li>\n      <li data-block-key=\"3b2gs\"><b>Modular by design:</b> Requires as little as 270M parameters for text-only workloads with optional vision (170M) and audio (300M) encoders for full multimodal support.</li>\n      <li data-block-key=\"dnah6\"><b>Storage-efficient:</b> Using Matryoshka Representation Learning (MRL), developers can dynamically truncate output vectors from 768 dimensions down to 512, 256, or 128 dimensions. This provides up to 6x storage reduction for local vector databases and memory usage.</li>\n      <li data-block-key=\"8mi3g\"><b>Optimized for on-device performance:</b> Runs efficiently within tight resource constraints. With quantization, on a Google Pixel 11 Pro, EmbeddingGemma 2 requires as little as ~191MB active RAM for text-only weights and ~567MB for the full multimodal model.</li>\n      <li data-block-key=\"86ksc\"><b>Extended context ready:</b> Features an 8K token context window (4x larger than EmbeddingGemma 1), allowing it to process up to 5.5 minutes of audio, 29 images, 58 video frames, or interleaved combinations thereof directly on local hardware.</li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"qbc6m\">Achieving top-tier quality for code, vision, and audio</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"eth4a\">EmbeddingGemma 2 matches the strong multilingual text performance of EmbeddingGemma while delivering a significant 9.92-point improvement on code performance (in MTEB Code, from 68.76 to 78.68), making it well-suited for local codebase indexing, semantic code search, and coding agent retrieval. Across image, video, documents, and audio, it sets a new standard in quality-per-parameter for sub-1B models and even outperforms some specialist models more than twice its size.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page--fullbleed uni-media-carousel-wrapper\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-media-carousel class=\"uni-media-carousel uni-page uni-grid\" data-shape-context-provider=\"\">\n    <!---->\n    <div role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" class=\" uni-carousel \" aria-label=\"Carousel\">\n     <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n     <uni-media-carousel-viewport slot=\"viewport\" class=\"uni-media-carousel__viewport\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"display: block;\">\n      <!---->\n      <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport\">\n       <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__container\" role=\"list\" style=\"inset-inline-start: -524.5px; padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px; scroll-padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px;\">\n        <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"purple\" shapes=\"[&quot;12-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"0\" accordion-header=\"\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\" alt-text=\"Massive Text Embedding Benchmark (Code)\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\">\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-media\">\n              <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n              <div class=\" uni-media__asset \">\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <div slot=\"image-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                <img alt=\"Massive Text Embedding Benchmark (Code)\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Text_Embedding_Benchmark_.width-100.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{\n            &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Text_Embedding_Benchmark_.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;,\n            &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Text_Embedding_Benchmark.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot;\n          }\">\n               </div>\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?-->\n              </div>\n             </div>\n            </uni-media>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <!--?-->\n         </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n        </div>\n        <!---->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"purple\" shapes=\"[&quot;12-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"1\" accordion-header=\"\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\" alt-text=\"Massive Image Embedding Benchmark (Lite)\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\">\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-media\">\n              <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n              <div class=\" uni-media__asset \">\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <div slot=\"image-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                <img alt=\"Massive Image Embedding Benchmark (Lite)\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Image_Embedding_Benchmark.width-100.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{\n            &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Image_Embedding_Benchmark.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;,\n            &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Image_Embedding_Benchmar.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot;\n          }\">\n               </div>\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?-->\n              </div>\n             </div>\n            </uni-media>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <!--?-->\n         </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n        </div>\n        <!---->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"purple\" shapes=\"[&quot;12-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"2\" accordion-header=\"\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\" alt-text=\"Massive Audio Embedding Benchmark\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\">\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-media\">\n              <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n              <div class=\" uni-media__asset \">\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <div slot=\"image-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                <img alt=\"Massive Audio Embedding Benchmark\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Audio_Embedding_Benchmark.width-100.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{\n            &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Audio_Embedding_Benchmark.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;,\n            &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Massive_Audio_Embedding_Benchmar.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot;\n          }\">\n               </div>\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?-->\n              </div>\n             </div>\n            </uni-media>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <!--?-->\n         </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n        </div>\n        <!---->\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </uni-media-carousel-viewport>\n     <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n     <div slot=\"controls\" style=\"display: block;\">\n      <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls-container\">\n       <uni-carousel-controls class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls\">\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls\">\n         <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__arrows\">\n          <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous item\" disabled>\n           <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M15.41 16.59L10.83 12L15.41 7.41L14 6L8 12L14 18L15.41 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n           </svg>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--next\" aria-label=\"Next item\">\n           <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M8.59 16.59L13.17 12L8.59 7.41L10 6L16 12L10 18L8.59 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n           </svg>\n          </button>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-bar\"></div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </uni-carousel-controls>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </uni-media-carousel>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"qbc6m\">Find full evaluation metrics and model information in the <a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/embeddinggemma/model_card_2\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">EmbeddingGemma 2 model card</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"nmcpy\">Enabling semantic search, routing, and retrieval, fully on-device</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"4fsdq\">EmbeddingGemma 2 brings robust capabilities directly to edge hardware. Generating embeddings locally helps ensure data privacy, reduces pipeline latency, and empowers developers to build cross-modal search and retrieval that works entirely offline.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"6d60l\">When paired with generative models such as Gemma 4, EmbeddingGemma 2 enables on-device RAG pipelines that understand complex multimodal data. Because EmbeddingGemma 2 is built on Gemma 4 and shares its text tokenizer and audio encoder, developers can run both models together in a unified pipeline with a lower combined total memory footprint.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page--fullbleed uni-media-carousel-wrapper\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-media-carousel class=\"uni-media-carousel uni-page uni-grid\" data-shape-context-provider=\"\">\n    <!---->\n    <div role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" class=\" uni-carousel \" aria-label=\"Carousel\">\n     <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n     <uni-media-carousel-viewport slot=\"viewport\" class=\"uni-media-carousel__viewport\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"display: block;\">\n      <!---->\n      <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport\">\n       <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__container\" role=\"list\" style=\"inset-inline-start: -524.5px; padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px; scroll-padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px;\">\n        <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"purple\" shapes=\"[&quot;12-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"0\" accordion-header=\"Use text or an image to find the top matches in your media library based on semantic similarity. Try it in Google AI Edge Gallery’s Instant Media Search.\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Video&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/google-ai-edge-gallery-instant-media-search_eRLOpvE.mp4\" section-header=\"EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\" alt-text=\"Google AI Edge Gallery’s Instant Media Search.\" video-title=\"Google AI Edge Gallery Instant Media Search feature\" autoplay=\"true\">\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-media\">\n              <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n              <div class=\" uni-media__asset uni-media__asset--mp4 \">\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n               <uni-video-player autoplay-override=\"\" muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Google AI Edge Gallery’s Instant Media Search.\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/google-ai-edge-gallery-instant-media-search_eRLOpvE.mp4\" tts-json=\"[]\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model\" video-title=\"Google AI Edge Gallery Instant Media Search feature\">\n                <!---->\n                <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n                 <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n                 <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Google AI Edge Gallery’s Instant Media Search.\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" style=\"min-height:0px;\" preload=\"auto\">\n                  <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/google-ai-edge-gallery-instant-media-search_eRLOpvE.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/google-ai-edge-gallery-instant-media-search_eRLOpvE.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n                 </video>\n                 <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n                </div>\n               </uni-video-player>\n               <!--?-->\n              </div>\n             </div>\n            </uni-media>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__caption\">\n           <uni-collapsable-caption collapsed-lines=\"2\" accordion-header=\"Use text or an image to find the top matches in your media library based on semantic similarity. Try it in Google AI Edge Gallery’s Instant Media Search.\" class=\"uni-collapsable-caption\">\n            <!---->\n            <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__content\" style=\"--collapsed-lines:2\">\n             <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-collapsable-caption__body\">\n              <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n              <div slot=\"caption\" class=\"font-caption\" style=\"display: block;\">\n               <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__caption-within\">\n                <div>\n                 <div class=\"rich-text\">\n                  <p data-block-key=\"qitkp\">Use text or an image to find the top matches in your media library based on semantic similarity. Try it in <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/edge/gallery\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Google AI Edge Gallery</a>’s Instant Media Search.</p>\n                 </div>\n                </div>\n               </div>\n              </div>\n             </div>\n             <!---->\n            </div>\n            <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n            <!--?-->\n           </uni-collapsable-caption>\n          </div>\n          <!--?-->\n         </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n        </div>\n        <!---->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"purple\" shapes=\"[&quot;12-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"1\" accordion-header=\"Locate specific moments in video using text or audio queries. Try it in Google AI Edge Gallery’s Video Moments Finder.\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <!--?lit$305792445$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Video&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;EmbeddingGemma 2: an open, lightweight multimodal embedding model&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uni